      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I'd also add that the addition of in-game performance profiling tools would GREATLY assist with tracking down badly optimized avatars so the users in question can be educated.\n\nHowever, balancing this against \"witch hunts\" would be difficult. I, personally, would like access to such profiling tools to help people.  That being said, I could see overzealous performance-hunting users kicking people that they profile as \"too heavy\" instead of trying to help.",
      "viewerReactions": null
