      "value": "@{59715a9e4979f85df8d62ef5|full_name}: In response to the \"Standard Shaders Only\" some shaders can increase CPU load by using multiple passes. Multi-pass shaders add an extra draw call for each additional pass.\n\nWhile it might be possible to prohibit multi-pass shaders a more direct solution would be to just limit the number of draw calls as opposed to limiting the number of materials or their shaders.",
      "viewerReactions": null
